# The receiver stops talking after one epoch: the fix is fresh at first (filled dot, ring), and after 5 s without a valid
# sentence it is stale: a hollow dot, no ring, the chip says how old the last fix is.
title GPS: stale fix, hollow dot
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480
env DECKATLAS_DEMO 1
env DECKATLAS_GPS auto
env DECKATLAS_GPS_FEED stale
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.889643,2.269995,16

wait 1500
shot fresh
expect text "3D fix 9 sats"
wait 5000
shot stale
expect notext "3D fix 9 sats"
expect notext "Searching"
